rough the WuKong action remote (RemoteActionFunction) the wheel itself uses. Turning this one on switches the 10x toggle off.While the Strawberry King event runs, walk to every landed strawberry coin and claim it over the EventBus remote (PickupStrawberryCoin) - one claim at a time, waiting for each answer.Upper edge of the window: never sell above this price. Both bars follow the game's own range (0.5-2.0, higher with bonuses); if the live price sits above this bar the log says so.Auto Dungeon ON - enters the boss dungeon portal as soon as one is open, starts the fight, holds 4x attack speed with click bursts and grabs every time coin.Everything the gear shop (\xE9\x81\x93\xE5\x85\xB7\xE5\x95\x86\xE5\xBA\x97) sells - multi-select, sorted by rarity and then by gold price. Auto Buy Item only ever buys from this list.Auto Buy Item ON - the shop remote is polled for stock every 5 s and a watched item is bought the moment its stock and your gold line up.Auto Claim Food ON - every 3 s: harvest every ant slot, then deposit the stored ant food into the balance.Anti-AFK ON - Idled is answered with a controller capture, plus a wake-up poke every %d s (keybind U).Auto Dungeon: inside the boss dungeon (boss #%s) - starting the fight and holding 4x attack speed.Auto Dungeon: entrance %s triggered (boss #%s) - the server is moving the character in.Auto Claim Food OFF - %d harvest(s), %d deposit(s), %s food moved, %s food gained.Black Market truck sell refused: the car is not in the workspace yet - retrying.Black Market truck closed - %d truck sell(s), %s gold. Normal market resumed.refused (coins short, a spin within 5 s, or a reward that cannot be granted)Fast Roll OFF - game roll presentation restored (%d rolls, %d attempts).Ant Empire ready \xE2\x80\x94 %d ants, %d mutations loaded from the game config.Client-side only: no remote is sent, nothing in the game is touched.Auto Sell 2.5x OFF - %d truck sell(s), %s gold earned at the truck.Food +%s (balance %s, harvested %d time(s), deposited %d time(s)).Auto Dungeon: run finished - %d kill(s), %d coin(s), reward %s%s.[Ant Empire] smart fit installed - automatic display fit, no tabStrawberry King is live (%s) - claiming every coin that lands.Live ant config unreadable \xE2\x80\x94 using the built-in ant list.Auto Claim Coin: PickupStrawberryCoin could not be sent - Window shrank to %dx%d - menu collapsed to its title bar.Spin Wheel: the spin request never answered - retrying.Lower edge of the window: never sell below this price.Battle.Game.Helper.RollPresentationHelper.RollManagerAuto Roll Spin Wheel 1x OFF - %d spin(s), %d refused.the entry was queued but the character never movedAuto Buy Item OFF - %d item(s) bought, %d refused.RollPresentationHelper / RollManager unreachableMount Training: pick an ant in Select Ant first.[Ant Empire] arvn section title size installedMount Training: no %s left in the backpack.[Ant Empire] arvn responsive fit installedBattle.Game.Helper.RollPresentationHelperFast Roll ON  - animations suppressed (entry sent - waiting for the teleport%s | %s | Mutation: %s | Cost: %s%sRemoteActionFunction is unavailableplace an ant in the ant nest first/\xE5\x8A\x9F\xE8\x83\xBD\xE5\x95\x86\xE4\xBA\xBA/\xE9\xA9\xAF\xE6\x9C\x8D\xE5\x8D\x95\xE4\xBD\x8D?\xE8\xB4\xAD\xE4\xB9\xB0the ant snapshot was unavailableTruck sell could not be sent: StrawberryKingCoinPickupResultEventBus RemoteEvent not found_genConfigs.event_tbturntablethis entrance is already used_StrawberryKingActivityCoinsSpin Wheel %dx refused - %sFilterDescendantsInstances%d run(s) | last reward %sStrawberryKingSpinSuccess_genConfigs.battle_tbunitAuto Roll Spin Wheel 10xGetPropertyChangedSignalWuKongHooks.AntFoodStoreAuto Claim Coin error: Auto Sell Food error: AssemblyLinearVelocity^StrawberryCoin_(%d+)$Auto Buy Item error: pick the ant to trainlevel %d - %d kill(s)MaxActivationDistanceClaimRolledAntResultBackpackHeldEntryKeyRemoteActionFunctionUI.TimeIcon.UsePromton - poke every %d sUI.Ride.Model.State__AntEmpireFas